Link: [Tableau Public Dashboards](https://public.tableau.com/app/profile/omid.darbandi/vizzes)

Description: Here is a collection of my Tableau dashboards where I practice turning messy data into clean, visual stories. It covers three different projects: Airline Delay Tracker compares major carriers to see which ones suffer from the most flight delays, the Video Game Sales Trends dashboard tracks 40 years of global data to find out which genres ruled different Nintendo consoles, and Traffic Accident Analysis breaks down road safety data to show how driver age, bad habits, and rainy weather connect to crashes. Each project focuses on taking a ton of raw numbers and making the actual takeaways easy to see at a glance.

Skills: Data Visualization, Exploratory Data Analysis, Calculated Fields, Interactive Dashboard Design

Technology: Tableau, SQL, Excel, CSV
